- Hindi and multilingual voice assistance.
- Advanced depth estimation.
- Real-time navigation assistance.

## ⚠️ Safety Disclaimer

BlindPath AI is an experimental assistive technology project. AI predictions may be inaccurate and should not replace a white cane, guide dog or established mobility assistance methods. Real-world deployment requires extensive safety testing.

